{"mode":"words","text":"A partir de aquí, tu objetivo de aprendizaje es lo que cuenta. Si solo quieres entender el idioma, ya has alcanzado tu objetivo: simplemente sigue con los pasos dos y tres. Si quieres hablar, llega el momento de hablar en coro: elige una frase corta con la repetición A-B, pon la velocidad muy lenta y habla al mismo tiempo que la voz, como en un coro. Notarás enseguida si algo suena diferente y te corregirás tú mismo. Esto se puede hacer en cualquier sitio, incluso en el tranvía: con auriculares, parece una llamada telefónica. Y si quieres aprender a escribir, simplemente escribe el texto frase por frase.","words":[{"s":0,"e":93},{"s":151,"e":464},{"s":511,"e":569},{"s":604,"e":917},{"s":952,"e":1022},{"s":1057,"e":1579},{"s":1637,"e":1695},{"s":1718,"e":2543},{"s":3053,"e":3228},{"s":3286,"e":3367},{"s":3402,"e":3495},{"s":3541,"e":4098},{"s":4795,"e":4981},{"s":5062,"e":5329},{"s":5387,"e":5677},{"s":5735,"e":6211},{"s":6269,"e":6339},{"s":6409,"e":7059},{"s":7500,"e":7605},{"s":7663,"e":7825},{"s":7883,"e":8382},{"s":8440,"e":8510},{"s":8533,"e":9253},{"s":10066,"e":10925},{"s":11169,"e":11564},{"s":11634,"e":11750},{"s":11796,"e":11936},{"s":12005,"e":12516},{"s":12957,"e":13236},{"s":13317,"e":13364},{"s":13433,"e":14118},{"s":14815,"e":14966},{"s":15035,"e":15349},{"s":15407,"e":16045},{"s":16487,"e":16788},{"s":16812,"e":16858},{"s":16928,"e":17369},{"s":17427,"e":17485},{"s":17520,"e":17833},{"s":17891,"e":17961},{"s":18031,"e":18704},{"s":19215,"e":19691},{"s":19749,"e":19900},{"s":19958,"e":20306},{"s":20376,"e":20759},{"s":20817,"e":20945},{"s":20991,"e":21038},{"s":21096,"e":21746},{"s":21862,"e":22222},{"s":22350,"e":22524},{"s":22582,"e":22652},{"s":22698,"e":23209},{"s":23267,"e":23441},{"s":23499,"e":23917},{"s":24196,"e":24370},{"s":24405,"e":24683},{"s":24718,"e":24788},{"s":24857,"e":25182},{"s":25241,"e":25519},{"s":25566,"e":25635},{"s":25682,"e":25751},{"s":25786,"e":26216},{"s":26332,"e":26552},{"s":26576,"e":26622},{"s"